@base = http://localhost:5080

### Create a short link (optional customAlias)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com"
}

### Link metadata
GET {{base}}/api/v1/urls/REPLACE_ME

### Click analytics (total, per day, top referrers); ?days=1..365, default 30
GET {{base}}/api/v1/urls/REPLACE_ME/stats

### Redirect to the target URL and record the click asynchronously
GET {{base}}/REPLACE_ME

### Ops
GET {{base}}/ops/stats
